    "temp_note": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "section_id": "poaching-temperature",
        "liquid": "<style>\n  .sea-pepper {\n    --ink: #171717;\n    --muted: #5c5c5c;\n    --line: #e5e2dc;\n    --wash: #faf8f4;\n    --gold: #bb8f50;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    background: var(--wash);\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    padding: 30px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 300px);\n    gap: 34px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__eyebrow {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    letter-spacing: .14em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--gold);\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin: 0 0 8px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__heading {\n    font-size: clamp(23px, 2.8vw, 30px);\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin: 0 0 10px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__lede {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: var(--muted);\n    margin: 0 0 22px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__rows {\n    display: grid;\n    gap: 14px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__row {\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    padding: 15px 17px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;\n    gap: 10px 16px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__row--pick {\n    border-color: var(--gold);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--gold);\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__name {\n    grid-column: 1;\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__tag {\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: .08em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: #fff;\n    background: var(--gold);\n    padding: 3px 8px;\n    border-radius: 999px;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__meter {\n    grid-column: 2;\n    grid-row: 1;\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 4px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__pip {\n    width: 9px;\n    height: 9px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 1.5px solid #d8cfc0;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__pip.is-on {\n    background: #b8462f;\n    border-color: #b8462f;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__note {\n    grid-column: 1 / -1;\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    color: var(--muted);\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__legend {\n    margin: 16px 0 0;\n    padding-top: 14px;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: var(--muted);\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__figure {\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__figure img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: auto;\n    display: block;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    box-shadow: 0 14px 34px -22px rgba(0,0,0,.5);\n  }\n  .sea-pepper__cap {\n    margin: 10px 0 0;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    color: var(--muted);\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 989px) {\n    .sea-pepper {\n      padding: 22px;\n    }\n    .sea-pepper__grid {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n      gap: 24px;\n    }\n    .sea-pepper__figure {\n      order: -1;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n<div class=\"sea-pepper\">\n  <div class=\"sea-pepper__grid\">\n\n    <div class=\"sea-pepper__body\">\n      <p class=\"sea-pepper__eyebrow\">The number that decides this dish</p>\n      <h2 class=\"sea-pepper__heading\">Poaching is a temperature, not a setting. Get it wrong by twenty degrees and you have boiled fish.</h2>\n      <p class=\"sea-pepper__lede\">\n        Almost every recipe that says &ldquo;gentle simmer&rdquo; is describing water around 185 to\n        200&deg;F, and that is already too hot for a steelhead loin. Real poaching sits lower than\n        most people expect &mdash; the surface should barely move. An instant-read thermometer in the\n        liquid is the whole technique; everything else here is assembly.\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"sea-pepper__rows\">\n      <div class=\"sea-pepper__row sea-pepper__row--pick\">\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__name\">\n          <span>160&ndash;175&deg;F &mdash; poaching</span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__tag\">As written</span>\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"sea-pepper__meter\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Agitation: 1 out of 5\">\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__note\">Barely a shiver. No bubbles breaking the surface, maybe a wisp of steam. The loin sets slowly and stays silky, and the flesh holds together instead of flaking apart in the pan.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sea-pepper__row\">\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__name\">\n          <span>180&ndash;190&deg;F &mdash; &ldquo;gentle simmer&rdquo;</span>\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"sea-pepper__meter\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Agitation: 3 out of 5\">\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__note\">Small bubbles start lifting off the base. The outside of the loin firms before the middle is warm, and white albumin begins weeping out onto the surface.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sea-pepper__row\">\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__name\">\n          <span>190&ndash;200&deg;F &mdash; simmer</span>\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"sea-pepper__meter\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Agitation: 4 out of 5\">\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__note\">A steady stream of bubbles. Proteins contract hard, the fish squeezes out moisture, and you get the chalky texture poaching exists to avoid.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sea-pepper__row\">\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__name\">\n          <span>212&deg;F &mdash; boil</span>\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"sea-pepper__meter\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Agitation: 5 out of 5\">\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sea-pepper__pip is-on\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"sea-pepper__note\">The loin will break apart and the liquid will turn cloudy. If it gets here, pull the pan off the heat and let it fall back before the fish goes in.</p>\n      </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"sea-pepper__legend\">\n        Ratings are how hard the water is working, not how hot it feels. If you have no thermometer:\n        bring the cider to a boil, take it off the heat for ninety seconds, then return it to the\n        lowest flame your hob will hold. That lands close enough.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <figure class=\"sea-pepper__figure\">\n      <img\n        src=\"{{ '20260825-Stetten-Wilson-285.jpg' | file_url }}&amp;width=700\"\n        alt=\"Fresh apple cider being measured out beside the poaching pot\"\n        width=\"1200\"\n        height=\"1600\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\">\n      <figcaption class=\"sea-pepper__cap\">\n        Two cups of cider, a splash of water, thyme and a bay leaf &mdash; the poaching liquid should\n        come about halfway up the loin, not cover it.\n      </figcaption>\n    </figure>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n",
        "padding_top": 40,
        "padding_bottom": 16,
