      "settings": {
        "section_id": "brown-butter-mustard",
        "liquid": "<style>\n  .sea-sheet {\n    --ink: #171717;\n    --muted: #5c5c5c;\n    --line: #e5e2dc;\n    --wash: #faf8f4;\n    --gold: #bb8f50;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    background: var(--wash);\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    padding: 30px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__eyebrow {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    letter-spacing: .14em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--gold);\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin: 0 0 8px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__heading {\n    font-size: clamp(23px, 2.8vw, 30px);\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin: 0 0 10px;\n    max-width: 22ch;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__lede {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: var(--muted);\n    margin: 0 0 24px;\n    max-width: 68ch;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__cols {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\n    gap: 14px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__col {\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    padding: 18px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__col--pick {\n    border-color: var(--gold);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--gold);\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__num {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    width: 26px;\n    height: 26px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: var(--ink);\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 0 0 10px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__col h3 {\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    margin: 0 0 7px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__col p {\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: var(--muted);\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__foot {\n    margin: 18px 0 0;\n    padding-top: 14px;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: var(--muted);\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 749px) {\n    .sea-sheet {\n      padding: 22px;\n    }\n    .sea-sheet__cols {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    }\n  }\n\n  .sea-sheet__fig {\n    margin: 22px auto 0;\n    max-width: 360px;\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__fig img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: auto;\n    display: block;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    box-shadow: 0 14px 34px -22px rgba(0,0,0,.5);\n  }\n  .sea-sheet__figcap {\n    margin: 10px auto 0;\n    max-width: 360px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    color: var(--muted);\n  }\n</style>\n<div class=\"sea-sheet\">\n  <p class=\"sea-sheet__eyebrow\">Where this one goes wrong</p>\n  <h2 class=\"sea-sheet__heading\">Mustard into hot brown butter will split.</h2>\n  <p class=\"sea-sheet__lede\">\n    The sauce is four ingredients and takes two minutes, and the only way to ruin it is to rush the\n    order. Dijon whisked into butter that is still frying seizes and separates into oil and grit,\n    and once it has broken it will not come back. The fix costs sixty seconds of patience.\n  </p>\n\n  <div class=\"sea-sheet__cols\">\n    <div class=\"sea-sheet__col sea-sheet__col--pick\">\n      <span class=\"sea-sheet__num\">1</span>\n      <h3>Brown it, then rescue the sage</h3>\n      <p>Butter and sage over medium until the milk solids turn nutty and golden and the leaves go\n      crisp, two to three minutes. Lift the sage out before it darkens &mdash; it is the garnish,\n      and it burns a few seconds after it crisps.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sea-sheet__col\">\n      <span class=\"sea-sheet__num\">2</span>\n      <h3>Off the heat, wait a minute</h3>\n      <p>Take the pan off entirely and let it cool until it is warm rather than hot. Then whisk in\n      the Dijon, the lemon and half the tarragon. Warm butter takes the mustard as an emulsion;\n      hot butter breaks it.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sea-sheet__col\">\n      <span class=\"sea-sheet__num\">3</span>\n      <h3>Loosen with the poaching liquid</h3>\n      <p>A tablespoon or two of the cider the fish came out of, whisked in, takes it from a paste to\n      something spoonable and ties the sauce to the dish. Season, then taste before it goes near the\n      platter.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <figure class=\"sea-sheet__fig\">\n    <img\n      src=\"{{ '20260825-Stetten-Wilson-294.jpg' | file_url }}&amp;width=760\"\n      alt=\"Sage leaves crisping in browning butter in a small cast-iron skillet\"\n      width=\"1200\"\n      height=\"1600\"\n      loading=\"lazy\"\n      decoding=\"async\">\n    <figcaption class=\"sea-sheet__figcap\">\n      The butter is ready when it smells like toasted nuts and the solids at the bottom have gone\n      the colour of weak tea. Off the heat from here.\n    </figcaption>\n  </figure>\n</div>\n",
        "padding_top": 24,
        "padding_bottom": 24,
        "divider": false,
        "narrow": false,
        "rounded": false,
