        "heading_tag": "h2",
        "subheading": "",
        "description": "<p>The method is fixed &mdash; soft leeks, low liquid, warm butter. Most of what goes in it can move, and the cider is the one swap that genuinely changes the dish.</p>",
        "heading": "Swaps that work",
